      "act": "ASK",
      "new_visual_element": "Claude composer, the ask lands answered",
      "narration": "Hi, I am Kehinde Obidele and this video is about what actually happens when you call backward on a neural network. Every framework hides it behind a single line of code. I wanted to know what that line really does, so I wrote the whole engine myself using nothing but NumPy.",
